      "chapter": "China in the United Nations",
      "table_no": null,
      "title": "[Topics of Dr. T. F. Tsiang's Statement to the Political Committee, November 25, 1949]",
      "caption_extra": "China's Case in the U.N. Opening the general debate in the committee, Dr. T. F. Tsiang presented a heavily-documented statement* which told of:",
      "continued": false,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": null,
          "columns": [
            "Item"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Soviet imperialistic designs upon China;"
            ],
            [
              "Soviet policy of preventing the National Government of China from re-establishing Chinese national authority in Manchuria;"
            ],
            [
              "Soviet policy of aiding the Chinese Communists in Manchuria, and facts relating to such active aid"
